{"applicability_conditions":"假设有序相的尺寸分布服从对数正态分布（log-normal distribution）。归一化条件：N(r) 分布曲线下的面积等于 1。","identity":{"block_id":"b0027","equation_id":"equation_003","equation_number":"3","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\mathrm{N(r)} = \\frac {1}{\\mathrm{rw} \\sqrt {2 \\pi}} \\exp \\left[ - \\frac {(\\ln (\\mathrm{r}) - \\ln (\\mathrm {r_ {p}})) ^ {2}}{2 \\mathrm{w} ^ {2}} \\right]\\tag{3}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.msea.2017.10.056"},"latex":"\\mathrm{N(r)} = \\frac {1}{\\mathrm{rw} \\sqrt {2 \\pi}} \\exp \\left[ - \\frac {(\\ln (\\mathrm{r}) - \\ln (\\mathrm {r_ {p}})) ^ {2}}{2 \\mathrm{w} ^ {2}} \\right]","purpose":"用对数正态分布描述有序相尺寸（半径）的归一化数量密度分布 N(r)。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"有序相半径 r 的归一化数量密度分布函数","symbol":"N(r)","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"有序相的半径","symbol":"r","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"有序相的峰值半径（对数正态分布的峰半径）","symbol":"r_p","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"对数正态分布的标准差","symbol":"w","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"对数正态分布归一化系数中的常数因子","symbol":"\\sqrt{2\\pi}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["该分布用于 Eq.(2) 中的散射强度 I(q) 积分计算。","真实数量密度分布表示为 d_N 与 N(D) 的乘积，其中 D = 2r。","有序相平均尺寸由 Eq.(4) D_ave = 2 r_p exp(w²/2) 计算。","上下文提到 Fe-Al (DO3) 有序相与无序 Fe-Al 基体体系。"]}